From 991531ed70c9e611a328380517a0d43db5bfbcfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:56:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Damage hooks: server-events.player-damaged and
 item-hit-damage (registration.damage)

player-damaged runs where NeoForge's LivingIncomingDamageEvent does (before armour and enchantments, past the creative guards) in every
player-damage path; item-hit-damage works the attack damage attribute before the attack-strength scale. Test mod: examples/damage-mods.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
